# A copy whose notes were saved is kept: item 1 copied with Ctrl-D, a line
# typed into the copy's notes and saved with Ctrl-S, which closes them;
# opened again and changed, F3 leaves them as Esc does, after asking; and
# the form left with Esc; the list says "Copied as item 4" and ends
# with it.
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-I
T I
K CTRL-D PGDN F4
T Copied note.
K CTRL-S
S NOTESAVE
K F4
T x
K F3
S F3ASK
T Y
S F3BACK
K ESC
S KEPT
K END
S LISTEND
K F3
T Y
